  "body": "I'm opening this PR to keep track progress of the `menuSelect` widget.\r\n\r\n* [x] displays current refined value\r\n* [x] update results after new selected refined value\r\n* [x] rename `RefinementSelect` to `menuSelect` (needs to get some input from the team about naming)\r\n* [x] tests \r\n* [x] documentation & examples\r\n\r\n**What project are you opening a pull request for?**\r\n- instantsearch.js (use develop base)\r\n\r\n**Summary**\r\nhttps://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/868\r\n\r\n**Result**\r\n![](http://i.giphy.com/3ohzdFZ8H5LRkKtCG4.gif)",
